   "name": "My dog's poop is yellow. Is that okay?",
   "acceptedAnswer": {
    "@type": "Answer",
    "text": "If it's a one-off and your dog is eating and playing normally, it may just be the food or treats. If it lasts a few days, comes with diarrhea or vomiting, or the eyes or gums turn yellow, talk to your vet."
   }
